| !EGLTri: mesa-demos' egltri (a shaded triangle in desktop OpenGL (redrawn on each key, no animation)), unchanged, through
| eglut and riscos-mesa's native EGL in a desktop window.
| Cursor keys rotate it. Escape or the close icon quits.
| The demo's text output (EGL version, FPS reports) goes to the file
| Output in this application; the newest line is shown in the title bar.
Set EGLTri$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set EGLUT$Output /|<EGLTri$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !EGLTri needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !EGLTri needs ARMEABISupport
Run <EGLTri$Dir>.!RunImage
